    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>line-chunk-prefix · 4×1×1 workgroups × 64×1×1 lanes = 256 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-line-chunk-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"61\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"3\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 64\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-line-chunk-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"64\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"2\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAACAAAAACCAMAAAAOwC77AAAAA1BMVEVfZnJNNohmAAAATUlEQVR4AQFCAL3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEIAAb1u9mUAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>64 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const lineOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; lineOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const rowMeasuresOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; rowMeasures: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const LINE_COUNT: u32 = 223u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"12\">const ROW_COUNT: u32 = 513u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const PREFIX_LANES: u32 = 64u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"14\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; largeBits: array&lt;atomic&lt;u32&gt;, 2&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; largeBitsCopy: array&lt;u32, 2&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; largeStart: array&lt;u32, 64&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; largeEnd: array&lt;u32, 64&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; prefixCarry: array&lt;f32, 3&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; tileLengths: array&lt;f32, 64&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; tileShifts: array&lt;f32, 64&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">const RADIUS: f32 = 1.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">fn getPosition(row: u32) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">  return vec2&lt;f32&gt;(positions[positionsOffset + 2u * row], positions[positionsOffset + 2u * row + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">fn getSegmentLength(a: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, b: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  return length(b - a);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"36\">@compute @workgroup_size(64)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"37\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  _ = &amp;positions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  _ = &amp;lineOffsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  _ = &amp;rowMeasures;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 67108864u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 64u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  let lane = localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  let lineBase = workgroupIndex * PREFIX_LANES;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  let ownLine = lineBase + lane;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">  // Phase 1: this lane&#39;s own line, serially when small; larger lines are queued for phase 2.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  if (ownLine &lt; LINE_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">    let first = min(lineOffsets[lineOffsetsOffset + ownLine], ROW_COUNT);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">    let last = min(max(lineOffsets[lineOffsetsOffset + ownLine + 1u], first), ROW_COUNT);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">    if (last &gt; first) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">      if (last - first &lt;= PREFIX_LANES) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">        var sum = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">        var compensation = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">        var shift = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">        var previous = getPosition(first);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">        rowMeasures[rowMeasuresOffset + first] = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">        \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">        for (var row = first + 1u; row &lt; last; row++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">          let current = getPosition(row);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">          let segmentLength = getSegmentLength(previous, current);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">          let nextSum = sum + segmentLength;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">          if (abs(sum) &gt;= abs(segmentLength)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">            compensation = compensation + ((sum - nextSum) + segmentLength);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">          } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">            compensation = compensation + ((segmentLength - nextSum) + sum);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">          }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">          sum = nextSum;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">          rowMeasures[rowMeasuresOffset + row] = sum + compensation;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">          \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">          previous = current;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">      } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">        largeStart[lane] = first;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">        largeEnd[lane] = last;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">        atomicOr(&amp;largeBits[lane / 32u], 1u &lt;&lt; (lane % 32u));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">  workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">  if (lane == 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">    largeBitsCopy[0] = atomicLoad(&amp;largeBits[0]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">    largeBitsCopy[1] = atomicLoad(&amp;largeBits[1]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">  // Phase 2: every barrier below is in workgroup-uniform control flow (the queue is read through\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">  // workgroupUniformLoad), and the queued lines are visited in ascending order.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">  for (var word = 0u; word &lt; 2u; word++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">    var pending = workgroupUniformLoad(&amp;largeBitsCopy[word]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">    while (pending != 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">      let slot = word * 32u + firstTrailingBit(pending);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">      pending = pending &amp; (pending - 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">      let lineStart = workgroupUniformLoad(&amp;largeStart[slot]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">      let lineEnd = workgroupUniformLoad(&amp;largeEnd[slot]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">      if (lane == 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">        rowMeasures[rowMeasuresOffset + lineStart] = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">        \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">        prefixCarry[0] = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">        prefixCarry[1] = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">        prefixCarry[2] = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">      for (var tileStart = lineStart + 1u; tileStart &lt; lineEnd; tileStart += PREFIX_LANES) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">        let row = tileStart + lane;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">        var segmentLength = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">        var segmentShift = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">        if (row &lt; lineEnd) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">          let previous = getPosition(row - 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">          let current = getPosition(row);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">          segmentLength = getSegmentLength(previous, current);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">          \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">        tileLengths[lane] = segmentLength;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">        tileShifts[lane] = segmentShift;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">        workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">        for (var offset = 1u; offset &lt; PREFIX_LANES; offset = offset &lt;&lt; 1u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">          var addedLength = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">          var addedShift = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">          if (lane &gt;= offset) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">            addedLength = tileLengths[lane - offset];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">            addedShift = tileShifts[lane - offset];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">          }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">          workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">          tileLengths[lane] += addedLength;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">          tileShifts[lane] += addedShift;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">          workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">        if (row &lt; lineEnd) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"134\">          rowMeasures[rowMeasuresOffset + row] = (prefixCarry[0] + tileLengths[lane]) + prefixCarry[1];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"135\">          \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"136\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"137\">        workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"138\">        if (lane == 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"139\">          // Neumaier-compensated carry of the tile total into the running measure.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"140\">          let total = tileLengths[PREFIX_LANES - 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"141\">          let sum = prefixCarry[0];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"142\">          let nextSum = sum + total;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"143\">          if (abs(sum) &gt;= abs(total)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"144\">            prefixCarry[1] += (sum - nextSum) + total;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"145\">          } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"146\">            prefixCarry[1] += (total - nextSum) + sum;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"147\">          }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"148\">          prefixCarry[0] = nextSum;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"149\">          prefixCarry[2] += tileShifts[PREFIX_LANES - 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"150\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"151\">        workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"152\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"153\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"154\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"155\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>positions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"positions\">positions</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>lineOffsets<span c